    "html": "<p>The kinetic energy of a proton is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span> and the kinetic energy of an alpha particle is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2E\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the ratio <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textup{de Broglie wavelength of the proton}}{\\textup{de Broglie wavelength of the alpha particle}}\\, ?\"></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\\sqrt{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
